(window.StoryDialogue = window.StoryDialogue || {})["ev-1"] = {"560101101":[["","XC 118, January 5th, Doll Arena"],["Commentator","Ladies and gentlemen! Let the Ultimate ST Championship finals begin!"],["Commentator","Tonight! One round! Five minutes! The ST getting beaten to scrap and possibly losing their life will be..."],["Commentator","The lone ST charging through Milkhama, two shotguns sweeping through the NDF; the three-time league champion, bounty hunter extraordinaire, \"The Cowgirl\"—<yellow>Rebecca</yellow>!"],["Audience Member A","Rebecca! Rebecca! Rebecca! Rebecca! Rebecca!"],["Audience Member B","Cowgirl! Bring home another trophy!"],["","Center stage: a wide-brimmed hat catches the spotlight, silver hair dancing."],["Rebecca","Yeehaw! I can't hear in all this hubbub, but I sure do feel your support!"],["Rebecca","Everyone, remember to scan the promo code on my ST. You can get a 15% discount on commission fees by submitting an order to <yellow>our mercenary team</yellow> in the pop-up screen!"],["Commentator","Thanks for the brilliant speech, Rebecca! Now, to find out which unlucky soul might not be making it out alive tonight..."],["","It's the mysterious pilot, <yellow>Camilla</yellow>, affiliation unknown! She's made it to the finals as this tournament's dark horse in her first ever championship appearance!"],["Audience Member A","Does anyone know this chick? I'm just here for Rebecca..."],["Audience Member B","Same... no info on Skynet. Where'd she come from?"],["","The mystery girl shields her eyes and watches the crowd coolly, still as a pond."],["Camilla","......"],["Commentator","Welcome, Camilla, to the USTF finals! So, tell us a little about your past."],["Commentator","Share your story before we really get this fight started!"],["Camilla","My past...? Sorry, <yellow>I can't remember anything</yellow>... I'm still looking for it..."],["Commentator","Cool line... Anything else for the audience?"],["Camilla","It's too noisy here."],["Camilla","Can we start? I want to get back in my ST... It's safer in there..."],["Commentator","Well, she's concise, I'll give her that... Before we start, a word from our sponsors..."],["Commentator","The USTF Championship's final match is about to begin!"],["Commentator","But before it does, remember to place your bets! Make a pretty profit from these poor souls!"]],"560101301":[["Camilla","After selling those unwanted Scorpicore parts and adding my fresh bonus, minus the gear I pawned earlier... hmm..."],["Camilla","Even with <yellow>Egu</yellow>'s connection, Harpy's offer still needs to be added to our budget. How about we lower the thickness of the armor there in the cockpit a bit?"],["Camilla","That voice in the arena... Who was it? Not ST comms... That feeling... So strange..."],["Camilla","No, focus on the ST for now..."],["","In the old hangar, Camilla stands before her giant ST, looking small and frail."],["","Her whispers echo off rust-stained walls with the rain, refining plans for her ST's upgrades."],["Camilla","No, no, these weapons are minimal. We need more to save everyone..."],["Camilla","Less than a week till the next guard change. Where to get more money...?"],["Camilla","Anyway, besides fighting, is there any other way? Will they even accept... more violence?"],["Camilla","I don't know..."],["","Silence falls heavy in the hangar. Camilla scratches her bandages, head down."],["","They're stained in blood, but she ignores them. She is accustomed to the pain and the running."],["","She starts planning again in her head."],["Camilla","We need assault power for a Hunting Grounds breach, even at shift change."],["Camilla","When dismantling those <yellow>Economizers</yellow>, we'll definitely come under attack... Ugh... my head... So what should I do...?"],["Camilla","Nuh-uh-uh... This won't work... Can I do it alone? This pain... No, I must hold on... They're waiting for me... <yellow>Sofia</yellow>..."],["Camilla","After the breach into the Hunting Grounds, follow the main road to... wait... which way... can't remember..."],["Camilla","..."],["Camilla","Out of <yellow>meds</yellow>... Damn..."],["","Camilla suddenly stops and turns to the corner, moving with her gaze while drawing a gun from her waist."],["Camilla","Who's there!"],["","Bang!"],["","Despite issuing a warning, she goes ahead and shoots into the darkness instantly, without hesitation or mercy."],["","Great, your condition is much better than I imagined."],["","A tall blonde woman appears. When did she arrive? Was it during the girl's mumbling or earlier?"],["???","At least you still remember how to kill."],["","Sensing danger from the approaching woman. Camilla raises her gun but can't speak."],["","She wants to shoot but can't. The woman takes the trembling gun and places it on the bench."],["","She'd regret shooting, Camilla thought. Never forget that regret."],["???","This proves you are an excellent <yellow>hunter</yellow>. No matter what happens, you won't stop."],["","The woman lifts Camilla's chin, forcing the bewildered girl to meet her gaze."],["???","Don't be afraid. Stay calm. Look at me."],["???","I'm here to help, Camilla."]],"560102101":[["???","Hehe... This really is a good hiding place. Those <yellow>Predators</yellow> are giving their all to expand their search, but they never thought that their prey could be hiding right under their noses, even participating in an ST tournament!"],["???","I was suspicious of this hangar too, but it's officially tied to a local mercenary crew. Not even a trace on the security cams... Now that I think about it, where'd they disappear to?"],["Camilla","..."],["???","Let's see... Skynet shows no contracts this past fortnight. No vacations... Something's got them tied up."],["???","The Predators will notice soon. Your time here is running out..."],["Camilla","Enough. Who are you?"],["","Camilla cuts off the stream of words about her dire situation, the mental pressure mounting."],["Eileen","<yellow>Eileen Dizion</yellow>, glad to be of assistance."],["Camilla","How'd you find me? I thought..."],["Eileen","Good, you're learning fast for someone with memory issues. Another Dive?"],["Eileen","It's a brief signal but detectable."],["Camilla","Damn, cutting that link at the arena..."],["","Melissa's strange signal made Camilla protect herself at the tournament, drawing the attention of their current visitors."],["","Perhaps driven by guilt, her headache flares up. Heat surges through her, and the coppery taste of blood rises in her throat."],["Eileen","Out of meds?"],["Camilla","Le... leave me alone! I don't need your help."],["","Human nature is strange. Throw something their way, and be it medicine or bomb, they instinctively reach out to catch it."],["Eileen","<yellow>EM14</yellow>, based on the original <yellow>MM42</yellow> and much more potent—suitable for lost little souls like you with one foot in hell..."],["Camilla","No... I don't need that..."],["Eileen","I would normally leave in this situation. It's like feeding a stray—drop the food, back away."],["Eileen","There's no time to waste now. Check surveillance. There's no choice for either of us."],["Camilla","!!"],["","But checking isn't necessary—the ground shakes and turbines roar as crimson search beams sweep the darkness, hunting their prey."],["Eileen","They're here, Camilla."],["Eileen","Get ready for battle."]],"560102301":[["","Camilla slows, having lost the Predators. Siniestro's trees offer shelter and breathing room."],["Eileen","Ready to hear my offer?"],["Camilla","As I said before, I don't have any connection to you..."],["Eileen","Are you sure this is the right time for that? If you want to kill yourself, there may be more efficient ways."],["","Camilla's ST stops at Eileen's words. The pain returns, and her bandages bleed."],["Camilla","This... *panting*..."],["Eileen","Did it happen again... the reports were right. Fighting worsens memory loss."],["Eileen","Time for those meds?"],["Camilla","No, I just need rest... a brief rest..."],["Eileen","You need to rest, but time's short."],["Camilla","..."],["","Eileen is right. Camilla swallows the pills gratefully."],["","She's used to being a tool. Cruel but effective. It's why she's survived this long."],["Eileen","Feeling better?"],["Camilla","Hmm."],["Eileen","So what are you thinking now? If you want to return to the <yellow>Hunting Grounds</yellow> to rescue your friends, you have no one to rely on but me."],["Camilla","But... who are you?"],["Eileen","Good. Let's discuss my goals, your plans, and what's happened to you."],["Eileen","Eileen Dizion, a special inspector for Obsidian's <yellow>Board of Directors</yellow>. My goal is to investigate the truth about the Rebirth Experiment."],["Eileen","Nice to meet you. Camilla, the only <yellow>free hunter</yellow> on Milkhama."]],"560103101":[["","Rebirth Experiment"],["","XC 105, human-machine fusion experiments commenced at Obsidian's Milthus branch. Codename: \"Hunting Grounds.\"\nThirteen years later, initial goals achieved."],["","The hypothesis is not making STs fit humans, but rather making humans fit STs."],["Eileen","I stand corrected. It may have started earlier than 105, possibly tracing back to the <yellow>Labor Poisoning Incident</yellow> in 85. It was then that the subtle effects of Arashium on the human psyche began to be looked into."],["Eileen","At that time, the reports only mentioned laborers repeatedly banging their heads on walls in the psych ward. Still, they didn't say that they also <yellow>synchronized</yellow> with the Arashium. Arashium destroyed their psyche but also brought them radically different abilities."],["Eileen","It became clearer after the 95 Labor Revolt—even dementia patients matched Obsidian forces in STs."],["Eileen","It sounds like an ancient farmer killing a trained soldier with a hoe—an impossible tale."],["Eileen","But that's precisely why, in the eyes of the megalomaniacs, these so-called <yellow>contaminations</yellow> should be the key to humankind's <yellow>re-evolution</yellow>."],["Eileen","And Camilla, as one of the test subjects who has undergone the <yellow>Rebirth Experiment,</yellow> you're no longer considered human, but rather a <yellow>Predator</yellow> who dominates the food chain."],["","Eileen shows data on the holo-screen. Camilla watches, uninterested."],["","There are two new STs behind them. Eileen helps modify one to Camilla's specs."],["Camilla","That's not \"Rebirth\" at all. They took away our memories... our past..."],["","Camilla frowns and then takes more pills."],["","No water needed. She's not a child anymore."],["Eileen","Memory loss is the goal, not the side effect."],["Eileen","Unlike the UNCS's Hyper-Aptamer, Arashium spine replacements aim for mind control."],["Eileen","The Rebirth Experiment is not about controlling STs. It's about merging pilots and machines."],["Eileen","In this process, your <yellow>memories</yellow>, which make you aware of your past as a human, need to be discarded."],["Camilla","Because human instinct is weak, it rejects <yellow>diving</yellow> with STs."],["Eileen","Indeed. You remember what happened at the Hunting Grounds, then."],["Eileen","It's like carving—keeping what's important and removing what's not. They used drugs to control you and <yellow>\"filtered out\"</yellow> the memories that were not needed, leaving only the skills left over from combat."],["Eileen","Many subjects revolted. Only one escaped."],["Camilla","But <yellow>Sofia</yellow>, <yellow>Damon</yellow>, <yellow>Egu</yellow>... they are still in there. I have to go back and save them."],["Camilla","What's your goal? You're Obsidian, why..."],["Eileen","Heh, you just need to know I'll help save your friends if you help me in the Hunting Grounds. The rest is classified."],["Camilla","Sorry, I can't accept that."],["","Camilla holds her head, groaning—every thought like a spike in her brain."],["","But she stays strong, watching Eileen like a trapped beast."],["","She would sooner chew off her leg before trusting a Hunter."],["Camilla","Tell me, what do you want?"],["Eileen","Who taught you to negotiate?"],["Camilla","That's none of your concern."],["Eileen","That glare suits you... Well, I won't hide it from you. I need to obtain data on <yellow>the most successful creation</yellow> of the Rebirth Experiment. This means you have to help me find two archives during the breakout."],["Eileen","That's not too much to ask, is it?"],["Camilla","Hmm..."],["","Eileen smiles at the silence and extends an equal hand."],["Eileen","We'll make good partners."]],"560103301":[["","Following Eileen's lead, Camilla moves through the Hunting Grounds carefully, deeply, and leaving not a trace behind."],["Eileen","Two minutes at relay. Wait for patrol, then end of the hall."],["Camilla","Got it... Eileen, how are Sofia and the others?"],["Eileen","Heh, there's no need to be polite. It's natural to worry."],["Eileen","Your three friends are the strongest subjects besides you. The key to this uprising."],["Eileen","They all gladly helped after learning about you—more willingly than you."],["Camilla","I already decided to avoid connections..."],["Eileen","They have fewer choices inside than you outside."],["Eileen","Like damned souls in hell, they would grasp at the slightest <yellow>thread</yellow> hanging down from the human world, desperately reaching, striving upward."],["Camilla","..."],["Eileen","First up is the apparent leader of this riot, <yellow>Sofia</yellow>, codenamed <yellow>Lone Wolf</yellow>, and the one you're most hung up on."],["Eileen","Before becoming a test subject, she was a renowned mercenary. Her leadership and combat skills made her a legend in the Hunting Grounds, earning everyone's trust."],["Camilla","Sofia's okay... thank goodness."],["","Seeing Sofia's image stirs feelings—relief, pain, raw emotion."],["","Like sweet poison... Camilla takes the pills to calm the storm."],["","She'll need these drugs forever—an eternal curse."],["Eileen","She sparred my ST and lured in guards for a chance to start the riot."],["Eileen","She cares for you like you care for her."],["Camilla","Sofia's the most reliable... thanks for telling me."],["Eileen","Then next we have this guy."],["Eileen","<yellow>Damon</yellow>, codenamed <yellow>\"Vulture.\"</yellow> He may be powerful, but he's the subject who has displayed the most worrying tendencies."],["Camilla","Damon's been here the longest..."],["Eileen","Yes, dangerous Arashi levels. An unstable mind... his true nature."],["Eileen","Files show he was a dangerous criminal before the Hunting Grounds..."],["Camilla","No, trust me, he's reliable... he trusts us."],["Eileen","Trust is vital, maybe more than anything else."],["Eileen","But what about this guy? <yellow>Egu</yellow>, codenamed <yellow>\"Hyena.\"</yellow> The way he looks and acts—most people want nothing to do with him."],["Eileen","Trickster, cheat... That's how he made a living."],["Camilla","Egu planned training tactics... always thinking ahead."],["Eileen","He's a shrewd one. Volunteered to scout away from the main force."],["Eileen","In a chaotic battle, who knows what he'll do."],["Camilla","..."],["Eileen","Even you can't trust your companions fully?"],["Eileen","Even though you came back to die for them."],["Camilla","I hope I can..."],["Eileen","Hope... Camilla, the truth is, you're not here to save them."],["Eileen","You're here because only their memories remain... there's nowhere else to go."],["Camilla","..."],["","Eileen's words silence comms. She's good at this."],["Eileen","You feel like you should do it, just like carrying out a mission in the past, so you still subconsciously say <yellow>\"mission complete\"</yellow> without even realizing it."],["Eileen","After all, if everything had gone according to plan, you'd have reached the final stage by now. After undergoing the <yellow>Disconnect Surgery,</yellow> you'd have been wholly stabilized and completed the experiment..."],["Camilla","No, I..."],["Eileen","Nothing wrong with that. Anyway, this is what you should do."],["Eileen","After this, a new start... I'll help as agreed."],["Eileen","That's enough."],["","Camilla doesn't fully understand. She wants to argue."],["Camilla","I don't understand... and I disagree... but thanks for the smooth operation so far."],["Eileen","Thanks, feels good to be appreciated."],["Eileen","We really are a good team."]],"560104101":[["","Hunting Ground Depths\nTraining Area"],["","The test subjects' rest area—cold metal lockers, one white bench—their whole world."],["","Three subjects negotiate with their instructor's hologram before training."],["Eileen","How does my plan sound?"],["Sofia","If what you're saying about Camilla's situation is true, there's no choice."],["Damon","I don't trust this woman."],["Egu","Why? Haven't you heard her offer? Leave the island, new ID, funds, treatment..."],["Egu","Haha, I can't wait for all the fun waiting outside!"],["Damon","She's <yellow>Obsidian</yellow>... Isn't that enough?"],["Egu","Internal conflict? The enemy's enemy is a friend, right?"],["Damon","We're all from Obsidian... you guys probably forgot."],["","Damon mutters, holding his head, holding something back."],["Damon","We'll regret... will regret... can only regret... haha..."],["Egu","So, should we listen to a half-mad killer over a helpful corporate inspector? Great idea."],["Sofia","That's enough, Egu."],["Egu","Hey, I don't want to go crazy with you guys. My brain is still under my control..."],["Sofia","Damon, I know you don't want to believe her, but forcibly taking Camilla out of the <yellow>laboratory</yellow> has already..."],["Damon","Do you think our situation won't get worse? This plan is like a <yellow>thread</yellow> hanging over hell. When it breaks, we'll only fall deeper into the abyss..."],["Sofia","I won't pass up a chance to escape. I'll take responsibility."],["Egu","Real comforting! You better mean that if we fail."],["Damon","Hell brings just more hell. Is a deal with the devil worth it?"],["Sofia","In hell, you can only make a deal with the devil... It's worth the risk."],["Eileen","I don't like being called the devil, but you can call me what you want if you cooperate."],["","Damon falls silent after Sofia's answer, pacing anxiously."],["","Finally, he stops—the best and only choice for all."],["Damon","One condition: we never have to deal with Obsidian after the escape."],["Damon","Promise me that, and I'll fully support your plan."],["Egu","What's wrong with you? I need her help—what else is there left for us besides arena fights?"],["Egu","Not just money—gear, meds, intel... without these, we're like... like..."],["Egu","Haha, runaway teens! Hilarious!"],["Sofia","I understand... Once we get out, I'm cutting ties with Eileen."],["Egu","What, are you crazy too? Miss Eileen, I'm different. Is the deal still good after?"],["Eileen","Fine, it's your choice to accept help or not."],["Sofia","Damon, is this okay?"],["Damon","I'll regret it... but I hope you won't."],["","Damon's silence means consent. With Egu's agreement, the three align."],["Eileen","So... your decision?"],["Sofia","We're ready."]],"560105101":[["Sofia","Even steel bodies can't cage our souls."],["Sofia","No one can."],["Camilla","Sofia..."],["","The impassioned speech suddenly falls into silence. Camilla unconsciously stands up and hands over the headset, holding her breath and listening. Still, she can only hear the clanging sound of the nearby guards being relocated."],["Camilla","Ah..."],["","After a long time, Camilla slowly puts down her hand and grasps the control lever again. The warmth in her eyes dissipates slowly, revealing her initial calmness."],["Eileen","Detected surveillance. Cutting one-way audio."],["Camilla","Understand, even one-way is risky... not complaining."],["Eileen","This saves me a lot of time."],["Camilla","Never mind... we'll meet outside soon."],["Eileen","Seems you really care about Sofia."],["Camilla","Yeah... despite having no memories..."],["","Her headache returns. Camilla deftly sends it away with a pill."],["Camilla","Remember, she's a reliable... strong... kind... trustworthy friend..."],["Eileen","Remember what she did?"],["","Camilla attempts to unearth more memories about Sofia. She searches hard, but it feels like searching for cotton candy in a fog—those memories do exist, but she doesn't know where to start."],["","Little by little, she could no longer remember what she was searching for. The clouds in the sky, or cotton candy? The distinction between them broke down. Eventually, the search lost meaning."],["","Losing memories is a terrible thing. It doesn't cause death, but it renders those most important to us <yellow>insignificant</yellow>, which is no different from the cruelest slaughter."],["","Both for the <yellow>one who forgets</yellow> and the <yellow>one who is forgotten</yellow>."],["Camilla","Sorry... I can't remember clearly..."],["Eileen","..."],["Camilla","Eileen, is this helping them?"],["Eileen","Yes, two teams are dividing guard attention."],["Eileen","You'll save them, I promise."],["Camilla","Okay..."]],"560105301":[["","The Far Side\nPredators Preparation Room"],["","A dim prep room, one ST's lights glowing. A tall woman tuning the controls, purplish-red hair flowing like pre-storm skies—beautiful, deadly."],["","Her hand freezes mid-motion, memories interrupted. She mutters hazily."],["Catherine","Hmm..."],["Lucia","Catherine, it's almost mission time. Hurry up."],["Catherine","Hah, you can just give this mission to someone else, can't you? What is it? Catching refugees?"],["Lucia","Huh? You said you were bored..."],["Catherine","Not bored enough for that crap. Check the Hunting Grounds situation."],["Lucia","That reject camp? What's up?"],["","Although Lucia is full of doubt, she doesn't question her words too much and tries to send a signal as instructed. Catherine's intuition is often more convincing than logic."],["Lucia","Wait, the signals there..."],["Catherine","Oh? Something interesting happening."],["","Catherine's bored laugh turns dangerous, an aura of menace flowing from her."],["Catherine","What sweet ecstasy awaits me this time...?"]],"560106101":[["Predator","Damn, the subjects are functioning on another level..."],["Damon","Hmph."],["","Damon's bombs clear the Predators, and Sofia destroys the rest."],["Sofia","Good, this area's clear."],["","After a fierce battle, the squad earns some valuable rest time, allowing them to quickly fix the damage to their STs and open their cockpits."],["Test Subject","Captain, my medicine..."],["Sofia","Didn't ration your dose for a long fight... Anyone got extra meds?"],["","Sofia's eyes sweep her comrades. No response. They all know what the drugs mean post-escape."],["Sofia","Well... I have some extra..."],["Damon","Catch."],["Test Subject","Th-Thanks!"],["Sofia","Really, that much...? Damon, how long since you dosed properly?"],["Damon","..."],["","Damon stays silent. He always does, but this silence feels heavier."],["Sofia","Tell me if you reach critical."],["Damon","I can still feel myself forgetting... It's not so bad."],["Sofia","Damn it... No more ST piloting for you. It'll only worsen your condition."],["Damon","We no longer have that luxury."],["Sofia","Wait! Didn't Eileen promise to help with Disconnect Surgery after we escape?"],["Sofia","You just need to hold on a little longer. After leaving the Hunting Grounds, you'll enter surgery and be put into an <yellow>induced coma</yellow>. After the surgery is completed, your condition will be stabilized..."],["Damon","Enough! Sofia, if you're truly prepared, stop dwelling on this."],["","Damon walks past Sofia to his ST without hesitation."],["Damon","Survival means little to people like us."],["Damon","Soon enough, even the memory of our existence will fade away... What matters most is what we do while we're still ourselves."],["","Sofia turns to look at Damon. His expression is hidden, only his arm visible—waving either hello... or goodbye."],["Damon","I'll leave things to you from now on."],["Sofia","..."],["Sofia","No, I won't give up on anyone..."]],"560106301":[["","Damon's ST vanishes from detection range. He cuts all connections to prevent Predators from tracking their team through internal comms."],["Sofia","Damon..."],["Test Subject","Captain, we tried contacting the Egu squad but got no response..."],["Sofia","Egu... Could he also..."],["Eileen","His contamination level is nowhere near yours or Damon's. Let's not jump to conclusions about losing sanity from too many Dives."],["Eileen","Does he even qualify for Dive?"],["Sofia","No... After learning of Damon's situation, I worry that he may think the plan is doomed..."],["Eileen","And then he will choose to <yellow>betray</yellow> us and beg for forgiveness from those Predators."],["Sofia","Exactly... Tell everyone to cut communication with the Egu squad to prevent them from tracking our position."],["Test Subject","Do we really have to? What if it's just temporary interference..."],["Sofia","Do it now!"],["Test Subject","Copy!"],["Eileen","A wise choice... I've gathered enough intel from him. I'll continue guiding your escape route."],["Sofia","..."],["","Sofia pauses planning, fatigue hitting. She lies back, arm over her eyes, in momentary darkness."],["Eileen","You only have four minutes of rest time left."],["Sofia","That's enough."],["","Eileen's words trigger neural spasms. She takes a few pills to calm them."],["Eileen","How do those pills taste?"],["Sofia","I... I wish I could remember..."],["Eileen","I can provide <yellow>Disconnect Surgery</yellow> to stabilize your contamination at its current level, but the operation devices are probably only available off-island..."],["Sofia","It doesn't matter now. I promised Damon once we leave this facility, we cut all ties with Obsidian."],["Eileen","But he's gone... Even if you meet again, he won't be your ally anymore."],["Sofia","It doesn't matter. <yellow>A promise is a promise</yellow>."],["Eileen","Is that so... Then good luck to you, hunters yearning for freedom."]],"560107101":[["Camilla","Damon he... how can... Aaaahhh...!"],["","Post-dive, Camilla retches, suffocating. Her mind roars like an ST engine, endlessly generating pain."],["","The sudden weightlessness hits hard. Her stomach churns as her throat burns, desperately trying to reject this harsh reality."],["Eileen","Camilla... Pills... Quick!"],["","Eileen's voice seems distant and otherworldly but shows Camilla her only escape. She desperately shoves a handful of pills into her mouth."],["Camilla","Ugh... cough, cough, cough..."],["","The excess pills catch in her throat, absorbing moisture. She claws at her neck, coughing them across the cockpit."],["Camilla","Water... I need water..."],["","Thankfully she finds the cockpit's water bottle, greedily sucking through the silicone straw to wash down the remaining pills."],["Eileen","Calm down! You've... overdosed..."],["","The world flickers like a stop-motion video. Glowing objects leave trails as her vision shifts. Eileen's voice grows fainter as Camilla sinks deeper into the abyss."],["","Camilla pours more pills, like dropping stones in a well, waiting for echoes."],["Camilla","..."],["","Is it enough? After eternal moments, Camilla surfaces from the abyss. But whispers warn: it's not over."],["Sofia","I won't abandon anyone."],["","Maybe another dose will help..."],["Camilla","*gulp*... *sigh*..."],["","After swallowing more pills, Camilla lets out a long breath. She knew it was over—those unremembered words were just hallucinations."],["Camilla","Eileen, I'm fine now."],["Eileen","Really?"],["Camilla","I don't know how to prove that, but I think I am."],["Eileen","I'll take your word for it. The data shows your contamination levels are normal."],["Eileen","Taking that many pills at once is dangerous."],["Camilla","I didn't know what else to do..."],["Eileen","*sigh*... Let's do a quick test. Try to recall what you're doing and what just happened."],["Camilla","I'm on a break-in mission to help Sofia's team escape... I heard about Damon losing control... so... huh?"],["Eileen","What's wrong? Your answer was correct."],["Camilla","Eileen, <yellow>who</yellow> was the person I was fighting earlier?"]],"560107301":[["","Camilla ignores Eileen, silently following her route like an emotionless machine."],["","It isn't her usual headache acting up—she feels fine. But that very feeling unsettles her."],["","Those sweet poisons take what little she has left, trading her memories for temporary relief."],["Eileen","That's enough, Camilla. Stop."],["","Camilla halts her ST in cover. It isn't Eileen's command that makes her stop, but her overwhelming unease. She's grateful for the excuse."],["Eileen","For you pilots, getting stronger isn't always a good thing..."],["Camilla","That Predator called Hyena... did I mention him before?"],["Eileen","Yes, before entering the Hunting Grounds... you talked about how he always took advantage of others and was a coward on dangerous missions..."],["Eileen","How the other subjects disliked him, but he still prioritized everyone's survival when making plans..."],["Camilla","Why...?!"],["Eileen","Are you okay?"],["","Eileen recounts Camilla's recent past, then stops cautiously to check on her."],["","With that prompt, Camilla realizes what's happening. The cockpit mirror reflects her tear-streaked face."],["Camilla","Why... why did I forget again..."],["Camilla","I can't remember anything... I can't feel anything... Did I really say all that?"],["Eileen","Right."],["","Eileen stops pushing the mission and chooses to be a supportive presence instead."],["","After a while, Camilla recovers, wiping away tears. Her eyes will stay puffy for some time."],["Camilla","Eileen, can I get my memories back?"],["Eileen","When something is <yellow>lost</yellow>, it no longer belongs to you."],["","That's what completely forgetting means. Even as Eileen described Hyena, Camilla felt nothing."],["","These things that were once hers no longer hold a place in her mind."],["Camilla","I see... Now I understand why you said that earlier..."],["Camilla","\"You came here because their memories are all you have left.\""],["Camilla","I want to save Sofia and the others, but I want to recover my past through them..."],["Camilla","Yet I keep losing more... Without you reminding me... I wouldn't even realize..."],["Camilla","I... I'm so scared... What should I do...?"],["Eileen","Listen Camilla, there's only one thing you need to do."],["Camilla","One thing... What is it?"],["Eileen","Follow the plan and get everyone out of here."],["Eileen","You've done well. You never give up and show no sentimentality toward <yellow>traitors</yellow> or those <yellow>beyond saving</yellow>."],["Eileen","Trust your feelings and do what feels right."],["Camilla","Trust my feelings..."],["Eileen","You may find clues about your past here too."],["Eileen","You have the right to know them, even if they're no longer yours."],["Camilla","Understood."],["","Inhale, exhale. After several deep breaths, Camilla feels her nerves calm. Everything seems back under control."],["","Having Eileen beside her is reassuring. It's good to have someone trustworthy on your side."],["Eileen","Alright... I was going to hide some intel from you, but now I think I should share it."],["Camilla","What is it?"],["Eileen","During Sofia's retreat, some subjects got cut off and were trapped in the training grounds."],["Eileen","You're the only squad that can rescue them now."],["Camilla","On it."]],"560108301":[["Sofia","Wait, Eileen."],["Eileen","Time is running out. All Predators have mobilized. Soon..."],["","Eileen realizes why Sofia has made this unreasonable request and slows her speech."],["","How many were there at the start? Twelve? Eleven? Now just five STs remain, flickering like dying flames."],["Sofia","They've hit their limit. Even with meds, contamination levels are rising sharply..."],["Eileen","As stated in the report, the inability of subjects who have not undergone Disconnect Surgery to <yellow>continue fighting</yellow> is an unavoidable flaw..."],["Eileen","Understood. Let's rest in this warehouse for now."],["","It's worse than expected. Only one subject's mobile. The rest are down, wracked with pain."],["Test Subject","Captain, we lack tourniquets for first aid. Number 26 can't remember his name..."],["","He moves between cockpits, giving aid. Paper-white but determined through exhaustion."],["Sofia","Make a tourniquet from cloth and metal to stop the bleeding in his leg."],["Sofia","As for his name... remembering his number is enough to function. Memory loss is still manageable."],["","Sofia bandages another, sighing as she passes a heavy bottle of meds."],["Sofia","Give these pills to No. 26, they'll help. Take some yourself."],["Test Subject","Yes, Captain... We don't regret following you this far."],["","The subject takes the pills and hurries to help his wounded comrade."],["Eileen","He just wanted your remaining MM44 pills."],["Sofia","Maybe, but that's not his fault... Eileen, can we escape?"],["Eileen","Are you asking if these critically injured subjects can pilot STs again and fight fully armed Predators?"],["Eileen","And with Catherine arriving and our strongest, Damon, gone dark."],["Sofia","..."],["Eileen","Sofia, they believe in you, not me."],["Eileen","You shouldn't ask me this, even if I have an answer."],["Sofia","I know."],["","Sofia carefully bandages the subject's wounds, her chat with Eileen remaining private thanks to her tiny earpiece."],["Sofia","How is Camilla?"],["Eileen","Her contamination's risen slightly but remains manageable. Don't worry."],["Sofia","..."],["Eileen","At least <yellow>she can get out of here</yellow>, I can assure you of that."],["","Eileen's baseless promise soothes the growing anxiety in Sofia's eyes."],["Sofia","That's enough... Thank you again, Eileen."],["Eileen","True rebels don't break this easily... Sofia, you've already lost."],["Sofia","You may understand experiments, but not us subjects."],["Eileen","Really? I don't accept baseless denials."],["Sofia","We've endured many tests here. The worst was endurance training—staying alert for fifty-plus hours in a dark, cramped cockpit."],["Sofia","At first, you feel discomfort, thirst, and the heat. Biological needs overwhelm you, leaving pungent odors."],["Sofia","Gradually, the discomfort fades. Everything proving you're still you disappears. Even your hand vanishes in the darkness."],["Eileen","..."],["Sofia","In the ST, you can't see yourself or know where you are... You get lost, consumed by this steel cage, becoming part of it."],["Sofia","And that's what they want, for us to be on the same frequency as the ST, without a so-called <yellow>\"self.\"</yellow>"],["Eileen","Well..."],["Sofia","We're afraid of piloting STs, just like Damon. No one knows when they'll forget everything... and become nothing but a part embedded on a machine... becoming what they call a <yellow>Predator</yellow>."],["Sofia","Maybe we've changed without realizing it."],["Sofia","After all, memories retrieved after forgetting have lost their meaning..."],["Eileen","<yellow>The Ship of Theseus.</yellow>"],["Eileen","As planks decay and get replaced, on and on until none of the original wood remains, is it still the same ship?"],["Eileen","If not, when did it stop being the same ship?"],["Eileen","For you, perhaps the ship died when the first plank fell."],["Eileen","The researchers won't bother replacing all the planks. As long as it floats, fewer planks mean a lighter, faster ship, and that's what they want."],["Sofia","..."],["Eileen","Shouldn't that make you want to escape more? To preserve your memories?"],["Sofia","Even without experiments, today's me differs from yesterday's... We constantly change, willingly or not."],["Sofia","Escaping won't end our battles. With these bodies, fighting always leads to the same end..."],["","Sofia smiles suddenly, still uncertain but more at peace."],["Sofia","But Eileen, we'll keep chasing freedom. Still, dying here wouldn't be our worst possible end."]],"560109301":[["Camilla","Vulture... No, is it impossible for Damon to <yellow>recover</yellow>?"],["Eileen","You understand his feelings better than me."],["Camilla","..."],["","Camilla silently opens the bottle, crushes, and swallows despair's fragments."],["Eileen","You know memories borrowed after forgetting aren't truly yours."],["Eileen","Like sand slipping through your fingers, no matter how tight you grip."],["Camilla","...Eileen, I don't want to forget Damon."],["Eileen","Even knowing he won't return?"],["Camilla","If I forget him, too... doesn't that mean he's truly dead?"],["","Camilla's voice shakes, but she notices she isn't crying this time, albeit unsure of why."],["Camilla","So please listen. If I keep talking about him, I won't forget."],["Camilla","Damon wasn't a good person... He killed many people... but he was always kind to me in the Hunting Grounds!"],["Camilla","Before Sofia came, he taught me that hurting others was wrong. He said I should only use my power for protection."],["Camilla","He never believed in himself... but for some reason, he always believed in me..."],["Eileen","Camilla, stay calm."],["Camilla","..."],["Camilla","Eileen, I love the outside world. These two months, I've seen something new every day."],["Camilla","Sunlight, forests, malls... normal lives... I knew they existed but never dreamed of them until now."],["Camilla","But the more I see, the more I want to know one thing... In this world, how should people like us <yellow>live on</yellow>?"],["Eileen","Don't worry. I'll arrange transport off the island, then..."],["Camilla","I mean... how do I survive on my own?"],["Camilla","What else can I do besides fight? Can I find work? Will anywhere... accept me?"],["Eileen","You can stop piloting STs and do whatever you want..."],["Camilla","No, I'm different from other subjects... They fear being consumed by the cockpit's darkness... but I embrace it..."],["Camilla","Quiet... warm... safe... screens like stars above... though I never knew the sky before..."],["Camilla","STs are weapons, and people like me can only fight... Like Damon said, no one out there accepts our kind..."],["","Camilla rambles on, ignoring Eileen's responses. Like a child frantically repeating new information to remember it."],["","For the other subjects, the cockpit is a prison to escape. For her, it is an inescapable reality."],["Camilla","Those mercenaries... I just needed... somewhere to hide... had to... I'm sorry... Damon..."],["Eileen","Calm down, Camilla! Your contamination is spiking!"],["Camilla","..."],["Eileen","I don't know what Damon told you, but..."],["","Eileen stops as Camilla's trembling ceases. Her tears well up at the mention of Damon's name."],["","Her heart died long before her body could process the grief."]],"560111101":[["Eileen","Still the <yellow>same test</yellow>—recall who you are, what you are doing now, and what happened earlier."],["Camilla","I'm Camilla. I remember training in the Hunting Grounds, escaping, then returning to help Sofia's team escape..."],["Camilla","I faced a tough enemy... a fully transformed subject beyond saving... before that, a traitor called Hyena..."],["","Camilla regains her composure, recounting the events since the mission began. With Eileen's prompts, the memories align perfectly."],["Camilla","Was that subject Damon?"],["Eileen","Yes. I noticed his condition early and installed an Arashi jammer to prevent another Dive."],["Camilla","I see... Thank you, Eileen."],["Eileen","Save your thanks for later."],["Camilla","But Eileen, am I really not forgetting anything?"],["Eileen","Ask yourself, haven't you kept the most important things?"],["Camilla","Yes... I remember Sofia always protected me... Now it's my turn..."],["Eileen","You really came just to save her, didn't you?"],["Camilla","..."],["Eileen","The others don't matter to you?"],["Camilla","No, Sofia would never abandon anyone... so I'll help make that happen."],["Eileen","Good. I worried you wouldn't want to rescue the others in the training ground."],["Camilla","Don't worry about my feelings... This was my choice. No regrets."],["Eileen","Good, you're much stronger than I imagined."],["Eileen","Open the panel above your left seat. I left something for you."],["","Following these instructions, Camilla finds two pill bottles."],["","<yellow>EM14</yellow>, a new drug specially made by Eileen. Camilla no longer has any doubts about its effectiveness. Since escaping from the Hunting Grounds, she had never felt as relaxed as she does now."],["","She knows depending on pills differs from taking them as needed."],["Eileen","You're out of pills, right?"],["Camilla","I feel fine, I should be okay for now..."],["Eileen","It's better to be safe than sorry, Camilla. You always have to be prepared for the <yellow>worst situation</yellow>... and so do I."]],"560111301":[["","As Camilla initiates Dive, the Hunting Grounds become a storm of Arashi particles to those who can sense them—colliding, merging, dispersing."],["","A blonde girl stands on Vulture's destroyed ST nearby, solemnly gazing in Camilla's direction."],["Melissa","Camilla needs us."],["","The girl whispers while the silver-haired cowgirl beside her seems confused."],["Rebecca","Hmm? Eileen forcing her hand again?"],["Melissa","Not sure. But following this Arashi wave will lead us to them."],["Melissa","I've uncovered everything that happened here, past and present..."],["Melissa","This time, Eileen won't get away clean."]],"560112101":[["","Just one final stretch before escaping the Hunting Grounds."],["","Only two STs remain. Sofia and Eileen advance toward the heavily guarded exit."],["","Chaos, sacrifice, betrayal... Her companions are all gone. The once noisy comms are now silent."],["Eileen","What happened?"],["Sofia","Why do you ask?"],["Eileen","Your ST's biosensors show abnormal readings. You're feeling something."],["Eileen","Excitement or fear? Data can't tell them apart."],["Sofia","If I had to say... fear..."],["Eileen","Death?"],["Sofia","No."],["Eileen","That would've been my bet. We discussed this at the beginning."],["Sofia","I fear what comes after."],["Eileen","My promise still holds. She'll escape, I guarantee."],["Sofia","Not the coming battles but the distant future after I die..."],["Eileen","I see—much like before you came here."],["Sofia","You've seen my file?"],["Eileen","Of course. Unlike you, I don't work with strangers."],["Eileen","A refugee who joined up with mercenaries to earn passage off the island for your family."],["Eileen","During a mission, you discovered that your battle zone was near your family's camp. Worried about their safety, you left the team without permission."],["Eileen","But it was precisely because of your actions that the camp was hit by artillery fire, and the entire merc team was wiped out. You are responsible for all this."],["Eileen","Facing execution, you took Obsidian's offer and came to the Hunting Grounds for redemption."],["Eileen","You claimed it was to grow stronger, to fix everything. But wasn't it just another escape?"],["Sofia","..."],["Eileen","Don't remember? That's forgetting—when heavy memories become meaningless words without feeling."],["Eileen","History without its witnesses is just wasted paper."],["Sofia","No, I remember the great fire and my regret being there. I just don't know why I felt that regret..."],["Sofia","I will never forget this feeling..."],["","A tear rolls down Sofia's cheek."],["","She has become an unbreakable rock, but this solitary tear reveals her vulnerability."],["Eileen","Nonsense."],["Eileen","So? You worry she won't live as you hope after escaping. But what can you do?"],["Sofia","I don't know..."],["","Sofia wipes away the tear."],["Sofia","But maybe believing helps... I believe she can do it, fulfill our regrets... No, as long as she does what she wants."],["","Sofia faces Eileen's ST, confiding as if to Camilla."],["Sofia","Camilla, you're different from us. You don't need to carry this burden."],["Sofia","After you wake up from the <yellow>anesthesia of the Disconnect Surgery</yellow>, you have to escape to somewhere far away, start a new life."],["Sofia","Never look back, never."],["","Not encouragement, but a prayer—like a flickering lamp, weak yet trying to light endless darkness."],["Eileen","Why rush to say goodbye before reaching the end?"],["Sofia","I don't know. I never thought I'd be so scared my hands would shake..."],["Sofia","Eileen, can I ask a favor?"],["Eileen","Of course, the devil's always willing to make another deal... but is this wise?"],["Eileen","You chose to <yellow>believe</yellow> in her, didn't you?"],["Sofia","I thought I could be strong like Damon, but now I see I can't... That's why I'm afraid..."],["","Sofia's voice trembles as if echoing through an ice cavern, all hope frozen, tempting deals with the devil for warmth."],["Sofia","Take care of Camilla, it's my only request... Please..."],["Sofia","She's different from us, she shouldn't be treated this way... She has nothing left to lose..."],["Eileen","No, she's not as empty as you say."],["","Eileen's firm words stop Sofia's trembling."],["Eileen","She still has you, right?"]],"560112301":[["","The escaping ST flees into the dense jungle under the hazy moonlight, vanishing from detection."],["","The thin girl in the cockpit groans softly, unaware of what has happened. Soon, freedom will be her waking gift."],["","Eileen silently operates the ST remotely. Everything goes according to her plan, yet she falls into a rare moment of contemplation."],["Camilla","...Ugh... Sofia... everyone... Hmm..."],["Eileen","..."],["","Eileen, did the mission succeed? Is the \"most successful creation\" out of the Hunting Grounds?"],["Eileen","No problem, everything went smoothly."],["","Good, I've contacted the Chairman. The plane will be ready soon. When the time comes..."],["Eileen","Plans changed. I need to stay longer. Send the plane when I next contact you."],["","What the hell do you mean?! The board can't cover this up forever. If the Predators discover your true identity..."],["Eileen","Tell the Chairman the \"most successful creation\" isn't complete. He'll understand."],["","Even if he agrees, at tomorrow's meeting, the other directors..."],["Eileen","Those conservatives don't know how to beat madmen—building safe houses of straw while Predator storms destroy them."],["Eileen","I don't expect understanding or trust. Only deals and responsibility bind this world."],["Eileen","If anyone asks, tell them I'll handle this my way and take responsibility."],["Eileen","If anyone objects, splash water in their face."],["","Splash water? Huh? Eileen, I..."],["Eileen","That's all."],["","Eileen cuts communications. Through the ST's audio, she and the sleeping Camilla share the jungle's peace as if the fighting, betrayal, and sacrifice never happened."],["Camilla","Mmm... yeah..."],["Eileen","Sofia, what a troublesome request."]],"560113101":[["","Three STs escape through the breach. Camilla leading, Sofia's automated ST in the middle, and Eileen bringing up the rear."],["Eileen","Camilla, I'll explain everything later. For now, take the medicine..."],["Camilla","Shut up."],["","Camilla's voice is steady. Unlike the uncontrollable emotions and heat of past Dives, she feels only calm."],["","The pain is there, but it is bearable. Even as her body convulses from rejection, Camilla feels she can endure."],["Eileen","Even if you don't trust me, Catherine's forces are ahead. You have to change direction..."],["Camilla","Eileen, why is everything so unfair?"],["","Camilla doesn't change course. Her ST accelerates far beyond its limits, widening the gap with Eileen."],["","Her overtaxed body keeps warning her. Blood trickles from her nose, leaving crimson trails on her sickly pale skin."],["","Time falls away piece by piece—past, present, future... gone forever."],["Camilla","I tried so hard to regain what I lost. Why do I keep losing more?"],["Eileen","Since the Rebirth Experiment, your bodies have..."],["Camilla","Why do I have this body? Was it my choice?"],["Eileen","I'll find a solution, so for now..."],["Camilla","Don't worry about me. Soon, I'll forget all this and have nothing left."],["Camilla","Like the other subjects, after the Disconnect Surgery, I'll lose myself... blindly serving those I despised moments ago..."],["Camilla","Even though I desperately don't want to disappear... Ahhh..."],["Camilla","*you ******, I can't ****** believe this ****** is so **** AHHHH!!! *I** *d* *O* *n't***wANt***t0***diSApPeAr**************** !!!!"],["Camilla","I DON't waNT To diSAPpEaR, i dOn'T WaNt To DisAppEaR, i DoN't WaNt tO DiSaPpEAaaaaaarrrrrrr!!!"],["","Camilla's despair echoes through Eileen's comms. Her broken, distorted wails are like a dying stream, leaving Eileen in helpless silence."],["","She feels powerless too. Reality has broken from the plan, spiraling into chaos. No one knows what will happen."],["Camilla","..."],["Camilla","...But there's... nothing we can do about it..."],["Camilla","This moment was inevitable."],["Eileen","These drugs will help with the symptoms."],["Camilla","No, this pain... I must have felt it before, but now I understand what it means..."],["","Camilla wipes the blood from her face with a bleak but determined smile. Her mind is set."],["Camilla","Like knowing Sofia won't return and forgetting her, my body is selfish. Pain tells me these memories of sadness, regret, and helplessness are slipping away."],["Camilla","You're right, Eileen. Maybe it's better to forget some things, never remember them, like my blank past... Everything's so easy..."],["Camilla","But why is this pain so real?"],["Eileen","Camilla, giving up is not a choice you should consider."],["Eileen","It's true for both you and them..."],["Camilla","I have no reason to keep going."],["Camilla","Those who cared for me, those worth believing in, those memories... If I lose everything I have, this pain is all that's left."],["Camilla","And before I forget everything, I'll make those who caused this pain... taste it too."]],"560114101":[["","XC 118, January 5\nDoll Arena, Preparation Room"],["Commentator","Ladies and gentlemen! Let the Ultimate ST Championship finals begin!"],["","The thick concrete walls cannot block the impassioned speech. The stage's energy echoes through the vacant ST prep room, highlighting its emptiness."],["","A blonde girl stands on an ST's shoulder, petting its head with a gentle smile as though stroking a puppy."],["Melissa","Good, good, stay like this. If you mess up out there, I'll end up screwing bolts at Doll Industries..."],["Alyson","Hey! Melissa!"],["","Melissa looks toward the shout. A purple figure bounces below the ST."],["Melissa","Wait, I'll come down!"],["","As Melissa speaks, the ST activates, reaching to its shoulder. She jumps lightly onto its hand as it lowers her to the ground."],["Alyson","Amazing every time, like it has an autonomous program."],["Melissa","It only works with STs I know well. I've piloted this one for almost four years."],["Alyson","You've synchronized with your ST? My useless scientists haven't figured out how to do that after a whole year... Should I fire them?"],["Melissa","Don't be too harsh. The UNCS has been researching for over a decade without progress..."],["Alyson","Your private research at the UNCS can't compare to the Doll Group burning money on basic science."],["Alyson","I got ahead of myself. When I heard about Obsidian's Predators... no, forget it. Not the time to discuss that."],["","Melissa smiles politely. After working with Alyson for almost a year, she knows how the Doll Group heiress operates."],["","Often seeming to consult but already decided, treating others' advice as background noise."],["Alyson","A mysterious pilot with an Obsidian ST disrupted my plans, sweeping through her opponents and causing me three million in betting losses."],["Melissa","Three million... That's almost as much as I owe you..."],["Alyson","I sent you the match video, but there was no reply, so I came to check."],["Alyson","Of course, you were buried in your ST again. It's quite rude not to reply, you know."],["Melissa","You messaged me? Oh... sorry... didn't notice..."],["","Melissa wonders how Alyson might react if she knew she deliberately ignored those messages. She breaks out in a cold sweat."],["","She expected another outrageous demand like analyzing Obsidian ST specs from images... Just thinking about it gave her a headache."],["","Under Alyson's relentless pressure, selective message ignoring was one of Melissa's most impressive social skills."],["Alyson","Anyway, you and Rebecca watch out. Don't let me lose any money in the finals... One more thing."],["Alyson","Arena security seems glitchy. Check after the finals... Don't worry, you'll get overtime."],["Melissa","Got it..."]],"560114301":[["Melissa","Unbelievable, totally unbelievable... You knew she was an Obsidian Predator, and still you were so careless..."],["","In the prep room, Melissa paces anxiously, muttering. She's been like this for an hour since the incident."],["","Rebecca sits relaxed opposite her, sipping soda, her eyes following Melissa's movement."],["Rebecca","I told you. Camilla's different from other Obsidian folks. Not a bad person, that's why we could talk."],["Melissa","Huh? Still arguing with me? Too much beef jerky salt shrinking your brain?"],["Melissa","She's a Predator! How did no one question her uniform and let her reach the finals...? Ugh, my head hurts..."],["","Melissa frowns, rubbing her temple."],["Rebecca","Camilla just wants the prize money. She said she's competing to help her friends."],["Melissa","You can't trust anything the enemy says. They're Obsidian—what's prize money to them? They're not as broke as us!"],["Melissa","Wait... If you lost... doesn't that mean we owe Alyson even more? With interest...? Ahh..."],["Rebecca","It is strange she wants this prize money. Must be nothing compared to Obsidian's pay and benefits."],["Melissa","Forget about Obsidian's benefits... Rebecca, our troubles may be way bigger than that..."],["Alyson","Oh? And what troubles are those?"],["","Alyson's hand on Melissa's shoulder makes her body stiffening as she nervously turns her head to the side."],["Melissa","When did you get here...?"],["Alyson","Just now. Champion taking the money and running, a mysterious ST wrecking the prep room then vanishing. Troublesome. Quite troublesome."],["Alyson","What have you two been discussin vis-à-vis these Obsidian members causing trouble in my arena?"],["","Melissa and Rebecca exchange looks in silence, unwilling to admit that, after an hour of discussion, the only conclusion they had reached was that their debts might double."],["Alyson","Whether they're Obsidian is debatable. You can't assume everyone with their STs is with them."],["Rebecca","I have a lead. Camilla told me she's not Obsidian."],["Rebecca","Again, I don't think she's bad, just strange."],["Melissa","I'm starting to question your position on this."],["Rebecca","I met countless employers before you. I can spot jerks instantly."],["Alyson","Melissa, no leads on your attacker?"],["Melissa","No... She made perfect counter-surveillance, knew security systems, and hid ST movements flawlessly..."],["Melissa","The perfect crime, as they say."],["Alyson","Hmm... Exactly what those fools told me..."],["Melissa","Hate to admit it, but we know almost nothing about their motives..."],["Alyson","Almost... So you have some grand finale you've been saving for me?"],["","Alyson's question makes Melissa purse her lips."],["Melissa","The field pilot's likely an Obsidian Predator. She sensed my ability and could cut my connection."],["Melissa","This is my first time encountering this kind of thing. She may have similar abilities."],["Rebecca","Alyson, this wasn't our deal."],["Alyson","I know we agreed to hide Melissa and keep her power from causing trouble."],["Alyson","But it's different now, they've found us. We'll be sitting ducks if we don't act..."],["Melissa","..."],["","Both of them look at Melissa. Alyson crosses her arms, and Rebecca straightens up. The mood cools to silent pressure."],["Alyson","I can arrange other hideouts if needed."],["Melissa","Not sure... Dad would probably have done that..."],["Melissa","But I won't run anymore."],["Melissa","I want to understand my power. There's a good chance I'll make contact with Obsidian. Who knows when the next opportunity will come?"],["Rebecca","Is that so... Well, I'll tag along with Melissa and keep her safe."],["Alyson","Have you considered they might want you tracking them?"],["Alyson","The first step on the path of stupidity is thinking you're smart—my favorite setup."],["Melissa","It's possible... but besides wanting to understanding myself, there's something else."],["Melissa","That girl Camilla... when linking... I felt she needed help..."],["Melissa","For some reason, I want to help her."]],"560115101":[["","Late night, Rebecca and Melissa drive STs to an abandoned town."],["Rebecca","Here?"],["Melissa","No..."],["Rebecca","How'd you know? Your sixth sense pointed us here, Alyson found two possible hideouts and this one had unique signals..."],["Melissa","We only met once but I'd sense her nearby again."],["","Like scanning radar, the target appears as a bright spot."],["","Like magnets attracting or repelling in range."],["","Massive Arashi fluctuations give Camilla and Melissa extra sensing abilities—detecting their own kind."],["Melissa","Let's search anyway. We can't rely solely on my ability."],["Melissa","Plus, another ST might appear... Wait... Something's odd..."],["Rebecca","What? What's going on?"],["Melissa","That person who attacked me, she and Camilla were piloting the same type of ST—<yellow>Malthus</yellow>, produced by Obsidian, right?"],["Rebecca","Makes sense... Obsidian members using their STs..."],["Melissa","If standard issue is fine, then Malthus takes it further—an elite-class ST built for maximum destruction. Specializing in enhanced rocket coverage, this beast comes loaded with dual <yellow>Scorpiocore rockets</yellow>..."],["Rebecca","You mean Camilla is piloting an ST that <yellow>doesn't suit</yellow> her?"],["Melissa","Right, from her style in battle, she doesn't look like she's the type to use rockets."],["Melissa","Obsidian wouldn't misallocate STs. Each pilot gets custom machines."],["Melissa","Consider the pilot who tried to ambush me. After that blast, I can say she's a master with rockets. As for Camilla's claim of not being with Obsidian..."],["Rebecca","Hmm... What are you getting at, darling? Sorry, my brain's a bit slow today."],["Rebecca","Not everyone's an ST geek like you. To me, they're just vehicles—light, medium, heavy..."],["Melissa","First, I'm not a geek. Understanding STs is every pilot's duty."],["Rebecca","You are too a geek."],["Melissa","Whatever... So, if Camilla bought a black market ST, why use an unsuitable model?"],["Rebecca","So she got this ST through questionable means—theft maybe, or just lucked out finding an abandoned one?"],["Melissa","Let's skip the anime plot here."],["Melissa","If she stole it, she'd pick a better fit or sell it. I'd say theft is unlikely."],["Melissa","After ruling out the other options, plus her confession and that Obsidian uniform..."],["Melissa","Camilla's situation may be far worse than we thought."]],"560115301":[["","As expected, the other town is a purgatory of Predator wreckage, collapsed buildings, and raging fires."],["","The battle has just ended, the victor is gone, and only crackling flames echo their combat."],["Rebecca","We're too late..."],["Melissa","Yeah, but at least we didnt come away completely empty-handed."],["Rebecca","Right, like how we learned that the Predators dispatched two teams at the same time to sweep two towns?"],["Melissa","According to what that guy said just now... <yellow>\"Subject No.14\"</yellow>—they should be following this thread."],["Rebecca","Hunting their test subjects, huh? Fits your theory—Camilla's their fugitive."],["Rebecca","Then who attacked you?"],["Melissa","I don't know, but that's wasn't Predator style. It definitely wasn't one of them..."],["Melissa","But I'm more concerned about our current issue..."],["Rebecca","That coincidence, right?"],["Melissa","Why'd we meet another Predator team? Are they all hunting Camilla?"],["Melissa","Coincidences work in fiction. Not real life."],["Rebecca","Did someone set this up to make us fight the Predators?"],["Melissa","Right. Once we confirm that, tracing back the interests involved should lead to another clue."],["Rebecca","You mean, who'd benefit from us getting ambushed... Did Camilla draw us in to share her burden?"],["Melissa","Too easy, Rebecca—your limited thinking's showing."],["Rebecca","Melissa, holding grudges just makes life harder."],["Melissa","Think I'd pass up a rare chance to snap back at you...? Here's my thinking."],["Melissa","You reversed the sequence of events. Simple logic says the Predators attacked Camilla, then she drew us in to help."],["Rebecca","Ain't that the case?"],["Melissa","Basing plans on uncertainties is just like gambling..."],["Melissa","I'm the biggest uncertainty. Even after linking, Camilla couldn't be sure I'd come looking."],["Rebecca","Like love at first sight. No guarantee of a confession."],["Melissa","..."],["Melissa","Even if she was sure I'd come, she couldn't know when. That's the fatal flaw for that plan, leading to severe consequences should it fail."],["Rebecca","I see... If you hadn't come, the Predators might've caught her."],["Melissa","Maybe she gambled desperately, knowing the Predators would attack, praying we'd help..."],["Melissa","This makes less sense. She should've escaped before they arrived."],["Rebecca","Then none of this makes a whole lot of sense... Maybe it really was a coincidence..."],["Melissa","But what if we push that further—what if this plan was only carried out after it was <yellow>confirmed that we would come to help</yellow>?"],["Rebecca","You mean someone calculated when we'd arrive to draw the Predators into battle?"],["Melissa","Though I don't know who she is, I sense that the woman who attacked me orchestrated all this."],["Rebecca","Wait... Even I think that's a mite hasty."],["Rebecca","This isn't some locked-room mystery where we deduce the killer in five minutes flat."],["Melissa","Remember what the Predators said at first?"],["Rebecca","<yellow>\"Target ST not found\"</yellow>... That's it! The Malthus drew them here!"],["Melissa","Right. That woman's Malthus could've posed as Camilla's to draw the Predators' attention. It all makes sense now."],["Alyson","Melissa, I found that signal transmitter. Someone deliberately drew us here."],["Alyson","Obsidian recovery teams have arrived. I'll try grabbing some parts..."],["Alyson","(Hey! Back off or I'll call in my lawyers! This town's Doll Group property!)"],["Alyson","Clear out fast. If our forces show up, things could get complicated... Over and out."],["Melissa","So that hag confirmed our location and drew the Predators to Camilla, timing our encounter with one of the teams..."],["Melissa","By the time we realized, she'd achieved her goal."],["Rebecca","I know she blew you up, but \"that hag\"? Really? Didn't know you had it in ya."],["Melissa","I only talked with her once... but I sense she's the type to be pulling strings behind the scenes..."],["Melissa","I've experienced it before. I hate being manipulated."],["Melissa","I hate it more than anything."]],"560116101":[["","XC 118, January 9, Doll Hangar"],["","Early morning, Rebecca receives a message from Alyson and Melissa to come to a Doll Group hangar."],["","Alyson and Melissa silently sip on \"Ms. Chili\"—Milkhama's signature energy drink. Its unique spicy kick is perfect for these two girls still not quite brave enough for black coffee."],["","Both wear noticeable eye bags, looking unrested. One can scarcely imagine what could be weighing so heavily on their minds."],["Melissa","I called you here to go over the next steps in our investigation... We just wrapped up the basic dismantling and analysis of the Predator ST earlier this morning... Hmm..."],["Melissa","..."],["Rebecca","Melissa?"],["Melissa","*Zzzz*"],["","Melissa goes silent mid-sentence, drink can drooping, brown liquid soaking her pants as she sleeps soundly."],["","Rebecca moves in, takes her can, grabs some tissues, and wipes her clean."],["Alyson","She's been researching for three days straight without a wink of sleep. Let her rest..."],["Rebecca","You're looking worse for wear yourself. Shouldn't we all sleep before talking like this?"],["Alyson","No time. I'll briefly explain our findings."],["Alyson","Firstly, about the Predators."],["Alyson","Melissa studied their STs and found they have special modules with strict pilot requirements."],["Rebecca","Requiring abilities like Melissa's?"],["Alyson","She realized three days ago... Yes, activating modules requires a certain concentration of Arashi in pilots, greatly enhancing ST performance."],["Rebecca","So Obsidian created Predators by injecting Arashi... Sounds familiar..."],["Alyson","It's the same principle as the 85 labor poisoning incident."],["Alyson","I wasn't born yet, but the reports we've collected say it caused significant damage to the nervous system, and the most common symptom was <yellow>memory loss</yellow>..."],["Alyson","Take Melissa, she lost all pre-Milthus explosion memories—not from brain damage but from Arashi effects."],["Rebecca","So many folks suffering like Melissa from Obsidian's experiments... Just like Camilla..."],["Alyson","Yeah, but before we start getting emotional, let's continue."],["Alyson","From Melissa's description, her attacker knew Obsidian and the Predators well enough for this complex plan to work out. We think she's Obsidian too..."],["Rebecca","Wait... If she's Obsidian, why go to such lengths?"],["Rebecca","Damaging Predators, helping test subjects escape... It all goes against Obsidian's best interests."],["Alyson","True... However, internal strife's always a chronic problem for any organization. There've long been rumors in the business world about the struggle between the <yellow>reform</yellow> and <yellow>conservative</yellow> factions within Obsidian."],["Alyson","This Predator incident confirms those rumors."],["Rebecca","Hmm... Internal conflict in Obsidian... One faction must be unhappy with the Predator research, right?"],["Alyson","Exactly. Things seem surprisingly simple in the end."],["Alyson","Before Obsidian locked down the town, we found a local mercenary hangar."],["Alyson","From the bandages and medicine there, it was likely Camilla's hideout. We're still analyzing the clues..."],["Rebecca","But why's it matter? All Obsidian folks are no-good dirty two-bit varmints... except Camilla. Their leaders never mean well."],["Rebecca","I don't get the ins and outs of corporate warfare, but couldn't you just publish all this? Let Doll benefit from the fallout?"],["Alyson","If we stop here... go public without sufficient evidence, it could hurt Obsidian. Short their stock in the chaos and we could make tens of millions..."],["Rebecca","\"If\"... You wanna go further?"],["Melissa","I can't believe it... That Eileen woman sent me a DM."],["","Unnoticed, Melissa had already awakened. Whether it's a case of early morning irritability or not, she looks like hell."],["Melissa","Alyson, let me play the recording for Rebecca."],["","Melissa quickly works the computer, playing the morning message."],["Eileen","Hello Miss Alyson, Doll Group's Milkhama rep. I'm Eileen Dizion from Obsidian HQ, proposing a short-term collaboration."],["Eileen","I've noticed your costly efforts in securing ST parts. Surely you've learned a few Predator secrets and spotted an opportunity."],["Eileen","So, for deeper access to ST tech and even deeper corporate scandals, how about we partner up? The returns will exceed your expectations."],["Eileen","If you're interested, contact me."],["Alyson","That's all... Rebecca, understand what this means?"],["Rebecca","Oh, I know what this means, alright—a real life super-villain wants to work with us, and we're saying \"no.\""],["Alyson","No, I see a gamble. In corporate warfare, using outside force is extremely risky..."],["Alyson","Like back-alley surgery—who knows what kind of \"tips\" they'll snip away at when your back's turned?"],["Melissa","She's still acting all high and mighty, thinking she can manipulate everyone, even outsiders."],["Alyson","But it's exciting, right? I want to see what her deal's all about... I've got an inkling I won't lose this gamble..."],["","Melissa's face darkens while Alyson beams excitedly. Rebecca sits uneasily between them."],["Rebecca","So, our answer is..."],["Melissa","We accept, of course!"]],"560116301":[["Melissa","<yellow>MM42</yellow>... From the accompanying medication instructions, it is a stabilizer used by those test subjects, which can effectively reduce the damage of the Arashi matter to the nervous system..."],["Melissa","Similar to White Maple's Arashi suppressant, it is far better made, more effective, and stable."],["","In a Hunting Ground corner, Melissa and Rebecca paused from pursuit to review clues."],["","Melissa focused on the test subject's pill bottle given to Rebecca."],["Rebecca","Wasn't Obsidian trying to mess up test subjects' minds? Why develop this?"],["Melissa","Just injecting Arashi is like slaughter. These drugs make experiments controllable..."],["","Melissa suddenly opened the bottle, took a pill, and swallowed without hesitation."],["Rebecca","Shit! What are you doing!"],["","Rebecca snatched the bottle, looking incredulously between it and Melissa. The cowgirl panicked."],["Melissa","Hmm... Working now. Feels good."],["Rebecca","Isn't this for them? Are you crazy?"],["Melissa","Experience makes doctors, Rebecca. I take lots of meds. From the ingredients and instructions, it's harmless..."],["Rebecca","Next time warn me before doing weird things... Really scared me."],["Rebecca","Especially when those devices make you lose control... Sorry, I didn't know what to do..."],["","Rebecca squinted, wiping cold sweat from her brow."],["Melissa","Sorry. Won't happen again, Rebecca. I Promise."],["Rebecca","We can't guarantee nothing will happen. At least tell me what to do if it does."],["Melissa","I know..."],["","Melissa pulled notes from her pack, jotted down steps, and passed them to Rebecca."],["Melissa","Though unnecessary, that works... Back to my discovery."],["Melissa","These drugs are vital materials. Could help many sick Arashi miners... Wait..."],["Melissa","If these ingredients are helpful for stabilization... then the <yellow>EM14</yellow> found in that Hangar..."],["Rebecca","EM14? What's that?"],["Melissa","Alyson's people found EM14 pills in town—Camilla's, with ingredients but no instructions. Still analyzing..."],["Melissa","Using MM42 as a prototype quickly shows EM14's purpose... Strange she'd use it..."],["Rebecca","Is there a problem with Camilla's medicine?"],["Melissa","If I'm right, EM14 intensifies Arashi's erosion rather than stabilizing it."],["Melissa","For example, MM42 is used to apply appropriate brakes to the experimental process and slow down the forgetting process of the test subjects. On the other hand, taking EM14 is like stepping on the accelerator and <yellow>completely depriving</yellow> their memory."],["Melissa","For Predator test subjects, taking EM14 is suicide."]],"560117101":[["Alyson","Right. EM14 differs from MM42, which is not made in Milkhama's Obsidian factory. Labels show off-island origin."],["","Melissa contacted Alyson, confirming both drugs' sources from slight packaging differences."],["Melissa","Big help. We'll continue surveying."],["Alyson","Keep in touch. Eileen's floor plans and routes are still highly credible."],["Rebecca","We can't navigate this huge place without her guidance."],["","After ending comms, Melissa pondered, playing with MM42."],["Rebecca","What's wrong, detective?"],["Melissa","I can't confirm, but I think we're in deep trouble. Continuing could be very dangerous. Maybe we should withdraw..."],["Rebecca","But you don't want to. In some ways, you're more reckless than me."],["Melissa","Mm, true. So talk me out of it."],["Rebecca","Hah... Too much credit. Didn't I say before?"],["Rebecca","After losing hatred, I can only support you. You belong in front... Stop doubting yourself."],["Melissa","Fine... If things go bad, it's all your fault."],["Rebecca","Fine blaming me... So what feels wrong?"],["Melissa","From the start, I said sensing Predator STs lets me sense their pilots, too?"],["Rebecca","Yes, like comic book telepathy."],["Melissa","It's hard to describe. Maybe Obsidian's right. Predators transcend humans, communicating beyond language..."],["Melissa","Arena link with Camilla is fuzzy from a distance, but now, with these subjects, I see memories too."],["","Melissa frowns, feeling memories from merged Arashi, not her brain."],["Melissa","Before we came, Obsidian HQ inspector Eileen's arrival sparked riots. Many test subjects tried escaping but failed."],["Melissa","But there was one exception, which let us come here..."],["Rebecca","<yellow>Camilla</yellow>... She was the only test subject who escaped from the Hunting Ground. So she wants to come back here to save her fellows?"],["Melissa","Right. During riots, subjects prepared a remote-controlled Malthus for Eileen. Camilla provided biometrics."],["Melissa","Camilla might pilot Eileen's remote ST now. EM14 isn't in the subjects' memories—Eileen gave it after the escape."],["Rebecca","It feels like Camilla's just like you were—kept in the dark..."],["Melissa","Right... I know the grounds' layout now. We can gather tech and evidence without Eileen's guidance."],["Melissa","Though we can't save current subjects, our work can help future innocents."],["","Melissa suddenly stiffens mid-analysis, instinctively facing a wall like a fixed magnet."],["Melissa","This Arashi concentration... Is this their \"Dive\"?"],["Rebecca","Melissa, what's happening?"],["Melissa","It's Camilla. She's back in the Hunting Ground for some reason."],["Melissa","She's very angry."]],"560117301":[["Hyena","Is this all you know about the riots? Hehe, that's it..."],["Rebecca","Hey, though we won't kill him, can I hit him?"],["Melissa","Suit yourself."],["","They exit their STs. Hyena is tied to a pillar, only his head free. Rebecca's gun stays fixed on him."],["","With Melissa's OK, Rebecca gun-butts his chin. A tooth traces a bright arc."],["Rebecca","Wow, that felt good... But am I more of a villain bandit than a hero cowboy?"],["Hyena","Okay, fine, you two win... I thought we could talk civilly..."],["Rebecca","You don't look civilized, either."],["Melissa","No time to waste... Answer my questions honestly. I'll know if you lie."],["Melissa","Why lie to Camilla?"],["Hyena","Eileen told me... No, no, it wasn't planned. I never thought she'd return with Eileen."],["Hyena","I got an intruder alert and came to guard this room from further invasion."],["Hyena","When Camilla would kill me, Eileen messaged instructions to survive..."],["Rebecca","Why do I feel like he's not telling the truth at all?"],["Melissa","No, he's telling the truth. I sense it."],["Melissa","But partial truth breeds lies... Strange, you'd trust Eileen's instructions."],["Melissa","You betrayed riot subjects and shouldn't work with their supporter Eileen. Makes sense she'd let Camilla kill you... Unless..."],["Melissa","Your betrayal was scripted, too."],["Hyena","..."],["Rebecca","Hmm friend, don't make me guess your silence."],["Hyena","Yes... You're right..."],["","The boastful Hyena drooped like a wilted plant."],["Hyena","But you're wrong about Eileen. She's trustworthy. As Damon said, deal with the devil."],["Hyena","No doubt, devils keep deals. They worry about unseen costs."],["Melissa","Because they can't see the devil's intent."],["Hyena","I thought that too. I didn't join riots at first. I'm a coward afraid of death."],["Hyena","I once found a crippled, blind rat with a split belly in a gutter, just grunting."],["Hyena","I was miserable, but it had it worse. I thought it wanted a quick death, so I grabbed it to squeeze..."],["Rebecca","Hey, why tell this gross story? You're making me sick!"],["Melissa","Come on, Rebecca, let him finish."],["Hyena","But it wanted... to live more than I thought?"],["Hyena","I felt it gasping in my hand, warm body, not dying at all."],["Hyena","I gave it rotten ham, thinking I would end it when it stopped eating."],["","Hyena is immersed in recalling his strange experience, shrugging with an unoffensive smile."],["Hyena","A week later... Ha, the tough little guy survived! Can you believe it?"],["Hyena","Honestly, no, but I had to. Watching it circle my feet, I thought if this worthless life deserves living... I must too."],["Hyena","Even becoming a damn test subject."],["Hyena","I told Eileen I'd quit. I came to survive, had no talent, and wouldn't forget me. No need to climb that thread from hell..."],["Melissa","But why betray? For survival, you needn't fight."],["Hyena","Eileen gave me this reason. She told me that unless I turned <yellow>traitor</yellow>, everyone would die and no one would be able to escape."],["Hyena","Yes, I want to live but not see them fail... They gave me that rotten ham..."],["Hyena","So I played traitor early, replaced guards, and made paths for Sofia per Eileen's plan."],["Rebecca","What nonsense? You just cut team strength, only letting Camilla and Sofia through!"],["Hyena","I needed Predator—convincing victories. Eileen's terms never meant to save everyone..."],["Melissa","Eileen wanted precise control—battle numbers, piece sacrifices. Better controlling enemies, too. Hyena was such a target."],["Melissa","She promised you could survive, but only as a <yellow>Predator</yellow>. She also promised that your companions could escape, though really <yellow>only Camilla</yellow> would. That was the devil's bargain..."],["Hyena","There, I've told you everything."],["","Hyena slumps, smiling, awaiting his fate."],["Rebecca","Need me to handle him?"],["Rebecca","Despite his story, he's a Predator and traitor. Scum surviving at any cost..."],["Melissa","Hyena, if spared, you won't reform... impossible, right?"],["Hyena","Miss, I'm serving Predators now. What work do you expect?"],["Rebecca","So shoot him now, save unseen lives..."],["Melissa","No, we've no right now... A court trial would be nice, but we can't, so..."],["Rebecca","If you don't want to, then I'll do it for you..."],["Melissa","Rebecca, I said stop!"],["","Melissa grabs Rebecca's raised gun. Rebecca turns, seeing Melissa's tears."],["Melissa","I feel what he feels. No choice... Like Dad, then..."],["Melissa","We're lucky to have choices and fight still."],["Melissa","No pointless killing. Target the root, those high-up puppet masters... Our first deal still stands, right?"],["Rebecca","Tch..."],["","At Melissa's stop, Rebecca lowers her gun. Melissa wipes her tears, calming her shaky voice."],["Melissa","I won't kill you Hyena. Tell us all the archives and tech locations here."],["Melissa","But first, one last question."],["Hyena","Third wish, little miss."],["Melissa","Doesn't this life have <yellow>worth</yellow> to you?"],["Hyena","Mm... Worth it... Death scares me most."],["Hyena","Still, I felt I'd been punished as well—with some splinter of discomfort stuck in my head, somehow untouched by the experiment. And from that came a realization: the slowest road to death is simply to keep <yellow>living</yellow>."],["Hyena","I'm afraid of death and always living in fear."],["Hyena","Just like that <yellow>rat</yellow>."]],"560118101":[["Rebecca","Good, I didn't act. Who knew Hyena knew so many secret file locations. Mission complete..."],["Rebecca","Haha, remembered them to save his skin now?"],["Melissa","Hmm..."],["Rebecca","Why the face? We've done well. Time to withdraw?"],["Melissa","There is one more question... Rebecca, what's between Camilla and Eileen?"],["Rebecca","Well... it's cooperation, right? Eileen's helping Camilla get back to the Hunting Ground to save her teammates... and during the arena match, Eileen helped Camilla win, didn't she?"],["Melissa","No, that's not right... If that were true, then everything Eileen's done makes no sense..."],["Melissa","Why did she lure Predators to attack Camilla?"],["Rebecca","I... I wouldn't know about that."],["Melissa","Ah, she did it to gain Camilla's trust through deception... You and Alyson understand these tactics better than me, right?"],["Rebecca","I see... When she sent us to handle another Predator squad, it was to keep everything under her control."],["Melissa","Then why did she let Hyena deceive Camilla?"],["Rebecca","The way you describe it, she's recreating that scene. Some criminal aesthetic?"],["Melissa","If I'm right, she wanted Camilla to misjudge the Hunting Ground situation. Just like our mission brief—Eileen had a different script planned for Camilla."],["Rebecca","But what's the purpose behind these twisted plans?"],["Melissa","Don't forget the EM14 she gave to Camilla... Although it's all my speculation, maybe she did it to complete the <yellow>Rebirth Experiment</yellow> on her."],["Melissa","From the actual effect, she wants Camilla to completely forget her past and become the <yellow>strongest Predator</yellow>."],["Rebecca","Can't this be done with just the EM14 you mentioned?"],["Melissa","Perhaps Camilla's grip on her memories exceeds all expectations. She constantly fights against forgetting because she believes her companions can still be saved..."],["Melissa","She wants to save them."],["Melissa","Eileen's design was for her to stand <yellow>face-to-face</yellow> with her comrades of the past, to watch the betrayals, the sacrifices, the hopelessness play out once more—and thus shatter her faith completely."],["Rebecca","..."],["Melissa","On the surface they seem to work together, but Camilla was unconscious during the riot. Not knowing the full truth gives Eileen leverage to manipulate her."],["Melissa","Instead of force or temptation, she uses pre-planned scenarios and information gaps to make people willingly walk into her trap. That's how she operates."],["Rebecca","I get it now. If everything matches your theory, then it's not time for us to retreat yet."],["Melissa","Hmm... Does Rebecca think the same?"],["Rebecca","Didn't I say it from the start? I don't think Camilla's a bad person. During the arena fights, she was super careful not to hit the opponent's cockpit. That's not how a Predator thinks, right?"],["Rebecca","Now that I know she's in such trouble and I am free, I want to help her out. That makes sense, right?"],["Rebecca","And also..."],["Melissa","Oh? There's more?"],["","Rebecca gives Melissa a blank stare and continues."],["Rebecca","I don't know why, but when I first met her, it felt like meeting you for the first time... That shy little canary, knowing nothing but still awkwardly trying to do what's right..."],["Rebecca","This world is pretty messed up, with conspiracies, experiments, wars, and other tired clichés everywhere. It's nice to see people like you two."],["Rebecca","Like those Westerns where a few shots solve everything that actually existed."],["Melissa","Like me? I felt it when I first linked with her."],["Melissa","If something made me forget my father, forget you... I'd probably fight like Camilla."],["Melissa","I'll never let anyone touch what belongs to me."],["Melissa","..."],["Rebecca","..."],["","After a rather sentimental heart-to-heart, an awkward silence falls between them."],["Melissa","This is awkward. Say something..."],["Rebecca","So you can't sense Camilla's location? You were bragging earlier about being able to sense anything nearby."],["Melissa","I wish I could, but it's too chaotic in the Hunting Ground. Too many Predators and test subjects interfering with my senses..."],["Melissa","We'll have to wait for her to use Dive connection again. Then I can definitely find her."]],"560118301":[["Melissa","Ugh... my head... hurts..."],["","Melissa opens her eyes, momentarily confused by the unfamiliar ceiling above. It takes a moment to remember. Rebecca activates the ST's forced shutdown and hypnosis system."],["","She'd heard during intel gathering that the UNCS has tech letting people control STs with their minds. To counter that, this device is installed on all STs under her command."],["","Never thought it'd be used on herself. Melissa said with a bitter smile. And who'd have thought Rebecca would remember her messy handwritten note in that situation."],["Rebecca","Well look who's finally awake."],["Melissa","Rebecca... how long was I out?"],["Rebecca","Seven minutes. I found us a hiding spot. Those guards seem to have found something more urgent. They've all deployed and stopped searching for us."],["Melissa","I see... What about Vulture?"],["Rebecca","I cracked open his cockpit. He's out cold like you were. Didn't find anything useful on him... except this."],["","Melissa catches the object Rebecca tossed her—a voice recorder. She glances up at Rebecca."],["Rebecca","I've already listened. Everything we wanted to know... it's all in there."],["","Melissa presses play."],["Record","If this recording is playing, it means the Disconnect Surgery is done, and the only person listening should be me, Damon... no, now I'm called Vulture. You're not me."],["Record","You're very talented, so you won't remember much of the past after surgery. What I'm saying now will just be someone else's story to you, but you were me once. I know you'll listen to the end."],["Record","If you can find a piano, why not try playing it?"],["Record","Even without your memories, I believe your fingers will remember how to play. That's what you were originally good at, not killing."],["Record","The news speculates about why you killed - was it your strict mother or gambling father... no, neither. Only I know why you did it. It's in your nature."],["Record","The first time was unavoidable. Then crime covered crime, hell invited hell. You were so skilled that your evasion paved the way to destruction. Old dreams turned to falling meteors, leaving no trace."],["Record","Simply put, you're sick. Don't expect others to understand, you don't need treatment. This world will naturally reject anomalies like you."],["Record","Your redemption only exists in the past, and the past only exists in fragile human memory."],["Record","But Obsidian freed you from prison, brought you to this Hunting Ground, and let you fully express your nature... feels great, right? That's probably what you think now."],["Record","But even here isn't your place. Here, you're just a tool. The punishment you deserve won't vanish just because you're a useful tool. You're just continuing to run away."],["Record","But you met Sofia, Egu... As fellow beings, they truly understood and accepted you. If you'd met earlier, everything would... no, outside, you wouldn't have this relationship."],["Record","It's all because of Camilla, the mysterious Subject 14."],["Record","She wasn't our kind at all—untouched by the world, and so ready to reach out and understand whatever she met. If I hadn't seen it myself, I would never have believed someone like that could exist. No, that's wrong. Isn't that what we call a <yellow>child</yellow>?"],["Record","The time with her was redemption we never imagined while waiting for death called forgetting."],["Record","And she faces destruction without ever having a choice. This... is too cruel... So we want to give her a chance. This is our promise, the three of us..."],["","The recording pauses briefly as the deceased Damon shares his final wish with Melissa and Rebecca."],["Record","I don't know if we have the right to save others, but we still want to try, even if we're not the ones who can ultimately save her."],["Record","She needs someone from outside who truly sympathizes and wants to help... most importantly, someone who understands her."],["Record","As for us? For that overly kind child who always puts sacrificing herself for companions first, our existence would only hold her back from moving forward."],["Record","Now, I praise the fragility of human memory again. Being forgotten by her, giving her room to trust new companions—that would be our best ending..."],["","The recording continues playing, but Rebecca turns away. Even hearing it a second time is difficult."],["Record","If someone besides me is listening to this, it means I'm dead."],["Record","Thank you, stranger or someone I once knew. Thank you for killing me and giving me my deserved punishment. Do what you want with these meaningless memories."],["Record","I don't expect understanding. This is how the world should be."],["","With a click, the recording ends. Melissa stands up with a thud, her voice hoarse but determined."],["Melissa","She's diving again... Let's go, Rebecca."],["Melissa","<yellow>Camilla</yellow> needs us."]],"560119101":[["","XC 118, January 10th, The Far Side"],["","It's over. This is Camilla's second escape from the Hunting Ground."],["","Unlike her escape from last night, Camilla ran under the sun beside another ST, piloted by Melissa, a blonde girl."],["","This time, she has a real chance to break free from Obsidian's control. A future called freedom waits just ahead."],["Melissa","I'm Melissa, remember me? The one who threatened to burn your spine in the arena. Pretty nasty at the time, but it was a special situation..."],["Camilla","I remember you."],["Melissa","Well... where should I start? Huh? You still remember?"],["Camilla","And Rebecca, the cowgirl that everyone likes. Her fighting style is pretty cool."],["Melissa","You know about her? Good thing she's not here, or she'd never stop bragging..."],["Camilla","Hehe, sounds like you're close."],["","Camilla laughed at Melissa's complaint."],["Melissa","You seem more stable than I expected. I was too worried... Or maybe you've... never mind, that's not the point."],["Melissa","Anyway, I want to ask - will you come with me?"],["Camilla","Sorry... but I need to wait for Eileen. She'll come for me."],["Melissa","My investigation shows Eileen set countless traps for you, leading you step by step to this point."],["Melissa","She drew Predators to attack you to gain your trust, tricked you into thinking you could save your companions in the Hunting Ground, and worst of all, those EM14s keep taking your memories..."],["Camilla","I know all that. And you were sent into the Hunting Ground by her too, to make me think another squad existed?"],["Melissa","You know and still...? No, there's more. In the first riot, she also..."],["","Melissa can't understand Camilla's choice. As she anxiously tries to list more of Eileen's actions, her emotions unconsciously link her with Camilla."],["","She hadn't noticed during the fight but now understood—people like them need no words to understand each other."],["","Catherine was the same. The despair and madness radiating from her then was like endless towering flames."],["","Now Camilla also has a flame burning in her heart, but contained by hope and faith, revealing an eternal warmth."],["","Was it from Sofia? Or..."],["Camilla","This feeling... this warmth... I can really feel it this time. You seem better at support and communication than Catherine and me."],["Melissa","It might sound funny, but my goal is to free this island and save people like you."],["Melissa","In the world I envision, STs don't have to be just fighting machines."],["Melissa","If everyone could communicate and understand like we do, fighting and hatred would vanish. All evil would fall, and any problem could be solved."],["Camilla","That's a wonderful dream... But Melissa, I'm not like you. That's your dream to have."],["Melissa","No, I can't do this alone. I need everyone's help to..."],["Camilla","And don't say we need abilities like this to understand each other. Your cowgirl would be sad to hear that."],["Melissa","Uh, Rebecca..."],["Camilla","Even with my memories in tatters, I've learned to understand and trust others."],["Camilla","Though that person is always awkward, hiding their thoughts and pretending not to care or trust others... they just want to shoulder everything alone."],["Camilla","I want to help her. That's what I want to do now."],["Melissa","..."],["Melissa","Well, seems I've got no place to butt in anymore."],["","Melissa stops trying to convince her. More explanations and truths can change things, but maybe this is the best ending for now."],["","Some things are better forgotten, some better left unsaid. Eileen understood this, too."],["Camilla","But someday we'll meet again, and then I'll agree with you."],["Melissa","But..."],["","Melissa swallows and licks her lips."],["Melissa","What if you forget by then?"],["Camilla","As long as one person doesn't forget, the <yellow>promise</yellow> still counts."],["Camilla","Then just invite me again."],["Melissa","..."],["Melissa","People often say I hold grudges so... I must have a pretty good memory."],["Melissa","Camilla, I promise you, I won't forget."]],"560119301":[["","The Obsidian Secret Research Institute's Hunting Ground shut down amid controversy after a whistleblower's exposé."],["","At a press conference, Obsidian Board Chairman Alexander Obelisk launched a scathing attack on Managing Director Raphael Gideon, claiming the research proceeded without board knowledge. No response has yet been received."],["","During the turmoil, Obsidian's stock value fluctuated wildly. Doll Group's Fund secured billions in short-sale profits, denying any insider trading."],["","The Predators rose to prominence in Milkhama's underground, becoming a nightmare for troops and mercs alike."],["","Now, Doll Industrial Park"],["Alyson","Well done! This makes up for that Arena incident completely!"],["","Alyson danced around the whiteboard, recording the real-time drop in Obsidian's stock price and occasionally glancing at the ST parts production line, which had been improved using Obsidian technology. No, it should be called a <yellow>\"money-printing line.\"</yellow>"],["Rebecca","So, do we still owe the same amount? Now I see why they call loans a bottomless pit..."],["Alyson","One thing at a time. I'm clear with numbers... Hey Melissa, I was too busy trading to read that incident report. Mind reading it to me?"],["Melissa","It's break time now..."],["","Unlike Rebecca, who still has the energy to complain, Melissa collapses in her lifeless chair after learning that their work hasn't reduced their debt."],["","Her eyes looked like a dead fish."],["Alyson","What a shame. I was going to settle your overtime this month, but now I could pay it right away..."],["Melissa","..."],["","Melissa sat up straight with a business-like smile."],["Melissa","I think some things should be clarified now."],["Rebecca","I'm worried about your mental state..."],["Melissa","The Hunting Ground riot incident over <yellow>two months ago</yellow> was the root of everything. Eileen contacted Sofia, Damon, and Egu and offered to help them escape that place in exchange for the information about the <yellow>Rebirth Experiment</yellow>."],["Alyson","But that's just the surface story, right?"],["Melissa","That's right. Eileen's true target was the Test Subject No.14 - Camilla, the one they called <yellow>\"most successful creation\"</yellow>."],["Melissa","Camilla has been under the strictest control since birth and has never had any unnecessary contact with anyone. Because she lacked critical memory points, she could withstand large doses of <yellow>\"Arashi\" matter injections</yellow> and gained unparalleled ST synchronization potential."],["Melissa","Near the experiment's end, she was moved to the Hunting Ground to develop social skills. There, she connected with the three subjects, becoming companions."],["","When discussing Camilla's relationship with the three, Melissa pauses, hoping her words can properly capture everything from that recording."],["","She soon gives up. Without experiencing hell, how could one understand that desperate hope, hanging everything precious on a thread?"],["Melissa","The supervisor of the Hunting Grounds discovered Camilla's abnormal psychological activity and advanced the time of her <yellow>Disconnect Surgery</yellow>, hoping to end her experiment through forced measures to prevent unnecessary emotions from affecting the final quality of their creation."],["Alyson","That's when Eileen appeared, offering those desperate three a chance to save Camilla, right?"],["Melissa","Exactly. When Camilla fell into a coma due to the surgery, the other test subjects put her in a <yellow>Malthus ST</yellow> and let Eileen remotely control it, thus launching the <yellow>\"riot\" incident</yellow>."],["Alyson","As Eileen planned, all test subjects died in the riot while she escaped with Camilla's ST..."],["Alyson","But why not take Camilla straight to Obsidian HQ? Wasn't that her goal?"],["Melissa","If I'm guessing correctly, Camilla woke up after leaving the Hunting Ground, and Eileen didn't have enough means to control her at the time... Don't forget, she had the opportunity to become the <yellow>\"strongest.\"</yellow>"],["Alyson","So she just let Camilla roam free... Pretty confident with such a valuable asset. I wouldn't let go so easily."],["Melissa","Outside, Camilla couldn't remember the riot's outcome. She drifted between arenas, hoping to earn enough for equipment to return and save her friends."],["Alyson","So that's why she targeted my arena... Looks like we're about to step onto Eileen's stage."],["Melissa","After nearly two months of waiting, Eileen finally found an opportunity to gain Camilla's trust. She used the <yellow>Malthus ST</yellow> to lure Predators into surrounding Camilla. She then helped Camilla escape, thus estabilishing a bond of cooperation."],["Melissa","She also attacked me to get Rebecca and me tracking Camilla, eliminating a Predator squad to balance her plan's risks."],["Alyson","Hmph, she played us well."],["Melissa","Eileen assisted Camilla in counterattacking the Hunting Ground, not only to gain her trust, but also to use the drug <yellow>EM14</yellow> to destroy her remaining memories and complete her final experiment phase."],["Rebecca","And note: The drug alone isn't enough. Camilla needs to witness her former companions' fate to erase those memories fully."],["Alyson","I see... And she invited us to help balance combat risks with your fighting power?"],["Melissa","That's right. Our role was to attract the attention of the Predators, giving her a chance to open a <yellow>secret passage</yellow>, escape from the Hunting Grounds, and flee with Camilla."],["Alyson","Now I get it... But Sofia suddenly waking to buy you escape time seems odd."],["Alyson","This ain't some fantasy story! A knocked-out Predator doesn't just spring up and turn hero for you. If you ask me, Eileen's got her hand in this again..."],["Melissa","No, Sofia woke up and helped us out."],["Alyson","But Eileen could have operated remotely..."],["Melissa","I was there. Stop speculating. This report stays as is!"],["Alyson","How dare you take that tone! Kiss your bonus goodbye!"],["Rebecca","Hey, can I get a cut of her docked pay?"],["","After shutting down Alyson's theory, Melissa slumps back, eyes closed, muttering softly."],["Melissa","Eileen, what made you spare her final memory?"],["","Obsidian HQ Research Lab"],["HQ Researcher","Fascinating. What we never had, we can't lose. By extending modification cycles to decades, injecting Arashi from childhood builds resistance. No more memory loss concerns."],["","In the pristine lab, Camilla sleeps in intensive care. Dozens of monitors relay her vitals to Eileen and a researcher behind the one-way glass."],["HQ Researcher","Inspector, this is our best shot at the Rebirth Experiment. We must begin immediately!"],["Eileen","No."],["HQ Researcher","We've fallen behind the islanders multiple times. If we stay this cautious..."],["Eileen","Consider this: to defeat madmen, do we match their madness, or surpass it?"],["Eileen","Creating decades of completely blank memories takes work... Note that it's not the kind of darkness that comes from closing both eyes, but rather the kind of <yellow>blank</yellow> that comes from closing only one eye, which leaves no trace."],["Eileen","Camilla grew up here, knowing only combat. A blank slate. Even careful guidance couldn't guarantee how reality would color her perspective."],["Eileen","Lucky she found those flawed but perfect people... How fortunate..."],["","Eileen presses against the mirror, studying Camilla intently."],["","Camilla now wears loose hospital garments. Her bandages no longer hide scars and needle marks, but deliver stabilizing suppressants."],["Eileen","Sofia, your efforts weren't wasted. That fragile thread pulled her from hell back to this world - cruel as it is for Predators..."],["Eileen","I'll take over from here."],["Eileen","I believe... this child will go further than any of us can imagine."],["","Predators Prep Room"],["","After the day's mission, Catherine opens her cockpit at sunset. Though not tired, she slumps in her seat, staring at the lights—her usual way to relax."],["Lucia","Catherine, confirmed. Eileen Dizion, Obsidian HQ Inspector, took Camilla."],["Catherine","Just as I thought... Boring..."],["Lucia","This data and Test Subject 14 let HQ pressure the MD. More troops might deploy to the island."],["Lucia","Maybe negotiations buy time. The board might understand after seeing the data..."],["Catherine","Understanding? Ha! Try the Rebirth Experiment yourself before making such jokes."],["Catherine","People can never understand or trust each other... No, it's because we understand that we meet in storms, fight, and dance at the abyss's edge."],["","Catherine's fanaticism faded to calm acceptance of the coming storm."],["Catherine","In the end, we all stand alone."],["Catherine","Is that so?"],["","A question every soul knows but struggles to admit."],["Lucia","..."],["","So Lucia can only stay silent, seeming uneasy."],["","This allows Catherine to continue, but her words hold no more madness."],["","More like a eulogy for a predetermined end."],["Catherine","But being alone isn't bad. Camilla and I both know that."],["Catherine","I had all my past memories erased, while that guy never had anything that could be called a memory from the beginning. This makes us <yellow>true \"Predators\"</yellow> who can freely control those ordinary people."],["Catherine","It is hard to believe that, in the end, she took a path so different to mine. Seriously, I was trying to steer her back to the <yellow>right track</yellow> out of a feeling of kinship."],["Catherine","Forgetting and loss are our life's eternal themes. If we don't wash them away with destruction, we only hurt ourselves."],["Catherine","We have no right to happiness."],["","Camilla"],["","Do you remember us now, Camilla?"],["","..."],["","Sorry we couldn't be there till the end."],["","Everyone's forgotten everything."],["","But surely our promises live on?"],["","This next chapter is yours."],["","Your freedom."],["","That's enough..."]]};
